      "description": "The Amap POI search API (registered Web-service key, quota-based) is the official route to point-level place records (name/category/address/coordinates) for building a current-snapshot POI layer. It is distinct from Amap's migration-index product; the route is practical for a bounded personal-research collection, but its numeric quota and any retained/redistributed corpus use require a current licence check.",
