      "description": "This is the official, public current roster of China's national 5A scenic-area designations: the Ministry's query service returned 358 scenic areas across 24 pages on 2026-09-28, each with a province, name and designation year (2007-2024). It is the direct starting point for a scenic-area or city designation-timing roster, while announcement pages remain the right source for exact batch dates and documents. It contains neither codes, coordinates nor tourism flows.",
